{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33113","headline":"友人南游不回因而有寄 · 于武陵","name":"友人南游不回因而有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相思春树绿，千里亦依依。\n鄠杜月频满，潇湘人未归。\n桂花风半落，烟草蝶双飞。\n一别无消息，水南车迹稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《三体唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三體唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}